# Cataclysm Classic (COMPAT-3). Same file list as Kitbag.toc; the flavour difference lives in
# KitbagCompat.lua and there is very little of it — Cataclysm sits between Era and Mists and shares
# the older shape of every API Kitbag touches.
#
# VERIFY THE ## Interface NUMBER against the live client. It is not installed here, so this is the
# last published Cataclysm Classic build and not an observation. A stale one shows the addon as out
# of date and on some flavours refuses to load it.
#
# One genuine difference from Era, already handled generically: the relic slot and the ranged slot
# are both inventory slot 18, and Core.SlotsFor maps INVTYPE_RELIC and INVTYPE_RANGED alike.
